  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d2d6d5f24530ecfc450d965",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充满透明感的酱油汤底，口感清爽且鲜味十足。劲道十足的平打面，与汤底完美交织的一碗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aa06838eaad179f4d2c222f35bbc701fe16b0814cf12cb9875a1e188f06e106",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59971a5ba5575d80084b3e05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以豚骨酱油为基础的浓汤，与极粗面的相性绝佳。堆积如山的蔬菜和厚切猪肉，食欲MAX的一碗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92b0d5c5f54ee10339a053c123a59745d551d539246bc64af1f0b9233539033b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ce664151ef34c7de865352",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第2届拉面嘉年华",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d0f08c1a97d2f846fd5af0cd478959ec671dc3a4ca77f0fdaf5470d7c33f1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4da60deb344e79dcfefd36c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "漆黑的酱油汤底，融合了猪肉高汤的醇和滋味。切块的洋葱，加上满满的叉烧，令人愉悦的一碗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6803aabe6ccd4312124666e8dc92cbd5a37f8f82a451730f48e651bd99f90349",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c5d1864fad4cf290a2db208",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "辣椒和蒜味十足的汤底，在辛辣中带有蔬菜的醇厚。鲜辣肉沫和韭菜衬托出刺激的滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3007fa392102d4b83c7c0359ff090d24bb061fb9cb209c6ed3494711edaa3b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52ee1b98ece15bb150f19211",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "融入鸡肉和猪肉鲜味的酱油汤底，浓厚却不会吃腻。撒上的猪背脂与大青葱相映成趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a5d90924f5ca68fc79b04a2861a5b7ba462450705b5c20eb129affc632bbf98",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b283bb99f978dcc4a429d57c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "熬煮了众多食材的汤底有着独特甜味的柔和滋味。Q弹的细卷面，与豆芽和葱完美契合的一碗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2abafed24a5bb7e604eb2cafacf995dca7f8c93eefce3fbd31d04da88908a28b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d5abb5fb31d2ccbd6d2f5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "长时间熬煮的豚骨汤底，醇厚浓郁且如奶油般顺滑。口感爽脆的极细面与汤底相性拔群，绝对需要加面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "880647468e478ab1df996c9cf6accefd8b2b46353d7c2c92ed178210e0f400a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16e47c8d4071fd01ba541ec3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "倾注了所有感谢的配料快要溢出碗外，王道酱油拉面的集大成之作。是在各地拉面修行的结晶之作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9202e803a173a46c68ba69756aa89e06df0fe15a92d3dc1d8f87efbe0b74fb5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a0cc4e5c06e7b9c3d50bd22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "醇厚浓郁的讲究味噌汤底上，堆满了各种各样的配料。能尽情享受丰富的味道，服务精神满分的一碗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c6ab144fa9566db8e20b234dd180c4eb817660828a218146bc2ecd616369a71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "346"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c06509a6e6a0a4b94e73718",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "精心熬制的盐味汤底被众多严选食材鲜艳点缀。别出心裁的摆盘，让视觉和味觉双重享受的一碗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3586d57fe88b1e3d7a5d04b0d0f612cfb39efd27c3976bf466597309fa2df39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "347"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c5744c031c78cf390f9b6b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "引发话题的拉面活动再度来袭！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2dbc455ce0f31aec805fc5f3a0a19688a993140e59680297d96df1edd052729",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:670cb988250126dbc42774e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拉面嘉年华再次到来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "461e0c8bbe0481af24856af5a9b9aff17d1ac6ae0b7ef677c01663d1e14febd7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70a232b9592491f726912a45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "备受期待的特雷森轩于<region_name>开店！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b6df1ff9e6a04075802492876ff0b3f64423951bfbd34c0c56bfcceadb3528",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:655db807e1843b7937ec174e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森轩，于<region_name>出战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81e018483f3f0197a65e0a9c3cbad11d3fb5e127759c2327b32bf9e1d8f6ae8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d45381816a7ea08f47bf9be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森轩，第二章开幕",
      "source_fingerprint": "7422be3036350da26ce21c097eebedf599a7415803f20576fe4df70ac4525c9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c176af90a892115a57f9048e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森轩在<region_name>开店！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6682322c474d5b488cdf6afe9db82151bb43e237d29f9e4a39522f24bdab4fe6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34db91f7e7cdcba649ad534f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝品拉面引来粉丝大排长龙",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d60f3a556a03c8d42abc5a16b4cb3a74de6360458faa5c517695464c5b6f411",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11fe773974d355da3d587650",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正宗拉面洋溢着匠人风范",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59a1708d843053df34f67b8eec3541b726102439e07e6d1213ff2bed9db4e84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b1111bce8f4f249685c3d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<region_name>赛场的粉丝大满足",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b6602ab6edf91495098c8c7f8bff1db18fde93557ac646177b8daa4f341521",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:153c74c7270181c132fe101d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用拉面款待<region_name>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "007dd33a05c1646ed9d6a6892a26152bbb47afeea2cea1c68cc2ebf7752f4fd4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2babc974e413a57d15787f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "美味的制胜计时刷新！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7866fd378e4c1ce18684ba03ede695b053ee02ab574897320f37ae7391bea2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170ce69fc6ed537cc0a32ea2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对味道的讲究正在进一步加速！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd4dfdf3110b5772289a8be695dc7f4257ef8341d9febe0440ae74c511410c75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:409dd2c2e034a00d657b0c4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "千锤百炼的美味就在这里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40d2beeb7ce83c2d529a31611d5a1cc463b8f407eb0dab314c15fd644a265a5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eccc08cfddbe9cc2751b296",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用美味来展现进化的手艺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bad5878b924de098c751459518d2a53f9e8da16e51c7be5839c9faa9eccfd0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe87d295befcf03cc306f88f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "末脚十足！满载成长的一碗",
      "source_fingerprint": "5477ca5c6e3aaf76d4819261e7e4fb6c1f7b5f5cc398d17e69cdebc9e5b2ab2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "48"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7856b95da59416081d89c231",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超越上次的热烈盛况",
      "source_fingerprint": "6127947c6061b968ae764945ee93f9e2760a3f015c755ca36f0ff580268d2c28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "49"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a378ce52429894a7be4a12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森轩，于<region_name>出战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81e018483f3f0197a65e0a9c3cbad11d3fb5e127759c2327b32bf9e1d8f6ae8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fbba9bd83b5c6f46853f4b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在超美味的粉丝福利中笑容绽放",
      "source_fingerprint": "75646659f15431dadb1aa9513cecf0f29a1142530fd2887e1becf49b70e62b84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b437a099003a3c6ec372a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "香气四溢的热气引来大批来客",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa09dddfba878f20f23daccda8485c530c4902f6e6ba14e69b1be1bac7cb5b07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "51"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dca89eda8092ad9d8e587a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以浓口酱油的醇厚令粉丝着迷",
      "source_fingerprint": "55dea0fbe4f2f4c8ec3e899b82700b2879e83ea92cddb1f937c282f2974266bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27f6e6d778942c942b2326e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "洋葱口感闪耀的漆黑汤底",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c56b328ab923f5cffec2ca363fcf9e2951e025fd86fc85a0d5b75f7250ebb8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "53"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64471e5f4091723ef7fead08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鲜辣刺激直击心灵的一碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4108d4f84443d70edb8080b7ee8e1fc592a03e143d7629eb51cc503b3e86971",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc4a9b27c8f9f13927b68603",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "韭菜与鲜辣肉沫的破坏力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5593b18664e5f8b69fec9ec16155960f2b53589f64fbb49945238c6bc969f7f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22fef41013d0e4407c92c9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "满满的猪背脂令人极度上瘾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "057cd3775cc41d4c5fd50fec0d40726e7f46099bb70c60d530963cb6f4fe9007",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e684dd09f398ea9b510c14ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大青葱与猪背脂交织的协奏曲",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f045a3586ec2f3ae09f90b339ba7d3dbeb0a479fb76245cd9612a76ca8971c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "57"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b50c07b9b307bfd6729c3472",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "食材的鲜甜令人放松身心的一碗",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a585924384a577fe664447c90ac0f67368a5d3e77f7d02c1a1ee3ab5c8bc121",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "58"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a40c490ca184459519dff3a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "醇和鲜甜浓汤大受欢迎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a689c9da437997d8360e21d92d4a0055149ed85aefc4138ee401c6e04b9889a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "59"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4c669bfa4d4ffe10319aeb2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森轩，闸门开启！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31b48c14e662af49c8203dfd42cd2b64f4febce4d70ee3d3660b1b3eccafee39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d29ce1c8ae9a57b10d7282fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "豚骨的令人上瘾引发加面呼声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "955977d312e33f424737257c1649614c9b2f9409e397bd48b4ba81db4d7720c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad0730e1c4e9b31ba1a54f26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "极细面条交织着浓汤的醇厚",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f653b68ccd0aa37f4969f0151d79751c4bfde5a8a6c4df4f7d9c2c04ecf6fe1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "61"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ae3800b59f9d9f86cfcad7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "送上更加成长的美味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49776aa06dc6f2deaf96bca2ee39d8758f1414b4294aa948f579c3fcd0a5ee96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "62"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97e8890696e1ee307e5fedca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "回应粉丝期待的一碗",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a07cb34eb4f40f11d62bf02b1ad5383e13ad7bf852ad36af2c4bad79a8843a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "63"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7595ecd60a5d7108e23f14ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用拉面扩大对粉丝的感谢",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ebd4c90b9cc42f1c3c10783ca3837446a6d3d0792eab9e834554cabbf6d8d56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a56309f847dcd2d5417ec0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "温暖人心的拉面呼唤好评",
      "source_fingerprint": "76567f6370919bf5dd872b824ac664ece242f75f7a96b6648c78f92899ac4749",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11150064d475e42224d8bf2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "精益求精的一碗，于<region_name>提供",
      "source_fingerprint": "06a373967fa0d9a9668a3425eaa4c55159240aeae38727920387ce032b8837f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
